bility\" when the next esr branch is started. This breaks\nthe logic for determining which repository a release was made from. Since we also have code for determining the\ntype of release from the version number, we can just use that directly instead.\n\n(Note that the logic will not work for Fennec as all releases have transitioned to mozilla-esr68, but Fennec does not\nuse update-verify.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D38437", "files": ["testing/mozharness/scripts/release/update-verify-config-creator.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "effb051638bf62adceb861294b768b450d14e9a5", "parents": ["bc2dea8692c6b269fbfbaa162f753607c41182f2"], "tags": []}], "date": 1563470832, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "mozilla@hocat.ca"}, "467": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andr\u00e9 Bargull \u003candre.bargull@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1564330: Update tzdata in ICU data files to 2019b. r=jwalden a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com//D37546", "files": ["config/external/icu/data/icudt60l.dat", "intl/tzdata/GIT-INFO", "intl/tzdata/VERSION", "intl/tzdata/source/be/zoneinfo64.res", "intl/tzdata/source/ee/zoneinfo64.res", "intl/tzdata/source/le/zoneinfo64.res", "intl/tzdata/source/zoneinfo64.txt", "js/src/builtin/intl/TimeZoneDataGenerated.h", "js/src/tests/non262/Intl/DateTimeFormat/timeZone_backward_links.js", "js/src/tests/non262/Intl/DateTimeFormat/timeZone_backzone.js", "js/src/tests/non262/Intl/DateTimeFormat/timeZone_backzone_links.js", "js/src/tests/non262/Intl/DateTimeFormat/timeZone_notbackward_links.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a1b6b5f5806693cc5ff29a855a01faaa90357ae4", "parents": ["effb051638bf62adceb861294b768b450d14e9a5"], "tags": []}], "date": 1563564605, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "archaeopteryx@coole-files.de"}, "468": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No